Subject: crypto: wire up the al_ssm crypto driver

Tree: /mnt/2tb/unvr-port-refs/u-boot-v2026.07 (UBOOT_TREE)
Issue: #224

drivers/crypto/ is descended unconditionally (drivers/Makefile has a plain
`obj-y += crypto/`), so a subdir obj line plus a sourced Kconfig suffice -
the same pattern as al_eth under net/.

drivers/crypto/al_ssm/ is copied in from uboot-port/ by
scripts/uboot-build.py.

Was: CRYPTO_MK_LINE / CRYPTO_KC_LINE txt.replace() in
scripts/uboot-build.py.

diff --git a/drivers/crypto/Kconfig b/drivers/crypto/Kconfig
index 0d58e391..5d9daffa 100644
--- a/drivers/crypto/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/crypto/Kconfig
@@ -12,4 +12,6 @@ source "drivers/crypto/nuvoton/Kconfig"
 
 source "drivers/crypto/tegra/Kconfig"
 
+source "drivers/crypto/al_ssm/Kconfig"
+
 endmenu
diff --git a/drivers/crypto/Makefile b/drivers/crypto/Makefile
index e4a4482b..ddbc3614 100644
--- a/drivers/crypto/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/crypto/Makefile
@@ -11,3 +11,4 @@ obj-y += hash/
 obj-y += aspeed/
 obj-y += nuvoton/
 obj-y += tegra/
+obj-$(CONFIG_AL_SSM) += al_ssm/
